
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" 
      xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" 
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8">
    <title>儀度六壬擇日課單</title>
    <style>
        @page {
            size: A4;
            margin: 1.5cm 1.5cm 1.5cm 1.5cm;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 楷体, 楷体_GB2312, 仿宋;
            font-size: 15pt;
            line-height: 2.2;
            color: #000;
            background: #e87f32;
            padding: 25px;
            writing-mode: vertical-rl;
            direction: rtl;
        }
        .container {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: row-reverse;
            justify-content: space-between;
            height: 100%;
            min-height: 850px;
        }
        .right-column {
            width: 12%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding-left: 15px;
        }
        .main-title {
            font-family: 楷体, 隶书;
            font-size: 32pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 8px;
            writing-mode: vertical-rl;
            text-orientation: upright;
            text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }
        .middle-column {
            width: 75%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: flex-start;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }
        .content-section {
            margin: 15px 0;
            font-size: 14pt;
            line-height: 2.0;
        }
        .content-line {
            margin: 5px 0;
        }
        .highlight {
            color: #8b0000;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .left-column {
            width: 13%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: flex-start;
            padding-right: 15px;
        }
        .seal-box {
            width: 70px;
            height: 70px;
            border: 2px solid #8b0000;
            background: rgba(139, 0, 0, 0.1);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-family: 隶书, 楷体;
            font-size: 14pt;
            color: #8b0000;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            writing-mode: horizontal-tb;
            direction: ltr;
        }
        .note-text {
            font-size: 12pt;
            line-height: 2.0;
            color: #000;
        }
        .calendar-table {
            background: #f8d77a;
            border: 2px solid #8b4513;
            padding: 10px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            writing-mode: horizontal-tb;
            direction: ltr;
        }
        .calendar-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
        }
        .calendar-cell {
            width: 35px;
            height: 35px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 13pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #000;
        }
        .calendar-cell.red {
            color: #c41e3a;
        }
        .calendar-cell.blue {
            color: #1e3a8a;
        }
        .bottom-text {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 30px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            font-size: 11pt;
            color: #333;
            writing-mode: horizontal-tb;
            direction: ltr;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="right-column">
            <div class="main-title">立碑吉日</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="middle-column">
            <div class="content-section">
                <div class="content-line">
                    <span>張氏合殮佳城坐</span><span class="highlight">壬</span><span>山兼</span><span class="highlight">丙</span><span>山庚寅首座分金</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="calendar-table">
                <div style="text-align: center; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;">擇吉</div>
                <div class="calendar-row">
                    <div class="calendar-cell">甲</div>
                    <div class="calendar-cell">乙</div>
                    <div class="calendar-cell">丙</div>
                    <div class="calendar-cell">丁</div>
                    <div class="calendar-cell">戊</div>
                    <div class="calendar-cell">己</div>
                </div>
                <div class="calendar-row">
                    <div class="calendar-cell">庚</div>
                    <div class="calendar-cell">辛</div>
                    <div class="calendar-cell">壬</div>
                    <div class="calendar-cell">癸</div>
                    <div class="calendar-cell red">子</div>
                    <div class="calendar-cell blue">丑</div>
                </div>
                <div class="calendar-row">
                    <div class="calendar-cell red">寅</div>
                    <div class="calendar-cell blue">卯</div>
                    <div class="calendar-cell">辰</div>
                    <div class="calendar-cell">巳</div>
                    <div class="calendar-cell red">午</div>
                    <div class="calendar-cell blue">未</div>
                </div>
                <div class="calendar-row">
                    <div class="calendar-cell">申</div>
                    <div class="calendar-cell">酉</div>
                    <div class="calendar-cell red">戌</div>
                    <div class="calendar-cell blue">亥</div>
                    <div class="calendar-cell"></div>
                    <div class="calendar-cell"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="content-section">
                <div class="content-line">
                    <span>中華民國玖拾玖年歲次庚寅柒月大吉</span>
                </div>
                <div class="content-line">
                    <span>謹擇</span>
                </div>
                <div class="content-line">
                    <span>太歲</span><span class="highlight">庚寅</span><span>年</span>
                </div>
                <div class="content-line">
                    <span>太陰</span><span class="highlight">甲申</span><span>月</span>
                </div>
                <div class="content-line">
                    <span>太陽</span><span class="highlight">甲子</span><span>日</span>
                </div>
                <div class="content-line">
                    <span>太陰</span><span class="highlight">庚午</span><span>時</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="content-section">
                <div class="content-line">
                    <span>正堂批：期定擇吉期安葬</span>
                </div>
                <div class="content-line">
                    <span>宜用</span><span class="highlight">午</span><span>時</span>
                </div>
                <div class="content-line">
                    <span>合</span><span class="highlight">斗首</span><span>三元</span>
                </div>
                <div class="content-line">
                    <span>龍飛鳳舞</span>
                </div>
                <div class="content-line">
                    <span>富貴雙全</span>
                </div>
                <div class="content-line">
                    <span>子孫昌盛</span>
                </div>
                <div class="content-line">
                    <span>代代榮華</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="left-column">
            <div class="seal-box">
                擇<br>吉
            </div>
            <div class="note-text">
                <div>風</div>
                <div>水</div>
                <div>師</div>
                <div>選</div>
                <div>日</div>
                <div>課</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="bottom-text">
        天一算命网 · 八字算命、周易预测、居家风水
    </div>
</body>
</html>